Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='shellworker', at=datetime(2026, 9, 27, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='A service worker keeps the shell and nothing else; staleness is dated', body="*Local-first, and staleness is DATED* (`cache.ts`, `stale.ts`). A service worker keeps the SHELL and nothing else (`sw.ts`, 2026-09-27): every build file lives under `/b/<build>/`, cached under that build's name (learned at `b/current`), the API never. A start runs the build last heard, answered from the worker's cache and asked again behind it, so it waits on the network for nothing; the four heavy pages are chunks of its build; a running page is OFFERED a newer one (`newbuild.ts`) and never mixed with it. Data stays the replica's and the banner's: a chain served silently from a cache shows a number with no provenance. Typst's HTML is kept on the device by the content it renders (`rendered.ts`, 20 MB, least recently used first), and a tab's uncaught failure is one `warn` line on the box (`POST /api/client-errors`: a write's gate, a per-login budget, nothing stored).", rationale='Decided 2026-09-27.', supersedes=()))